      "en": "Don’t turn away to go after vain things which can’t profit or deliver, for they are vain.",
      "ko": "돌이켜 유익하게도 못하며 구원하지도 못하는 헛된 것을 좇지 말라 그들은 헛되니라",
      "source_text_hash": "034020f60386247fb2b3514a96e4ac8831d17132a4bbf3881f6f83c2ec46a31d",
      "translation_text_hash": "097817a98d1e61436790b214274fe648578204eb54b1e73abab5114512e39e68",
